ontas County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, April to May came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 29% of normal in January to February and 50% in September to October. Grid 27141 had its driest year in 1976 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
